      "title": "RDDT: The Front Page of The Internet",
      "fund": "Substack / Amits Deep Dives",
      "date": "December 2025",
      "summary": "The write-up covers Reddit's transformation into a category winner in digital advertising by applying standard ad tech infrastructure (conversion APIs, automated product recommendations) to its unique conversational database. The author highlights Q3 2025 financial strength with $585M revenue (up 68% YoY) and 40% Adjusted EBITDA margins ($236M), demonstrating software-like incremental margins. The memo identifies logged-out user monetization and recurring multi-year AI training data licensing deals as primary growth catalysts.",
